OL,3,GNEWSAWork on road safety scheme to
OL,4,Astart in January
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to improve the safety of a major
OL,7,Froad in Sheffield is expected to begin
OL,8,Fin January 2027 after #1.42m of
OL,9,Fgovernment funding was confirmed.
OL,11,FThe money will be used to improve the
OL,12,FA625 Ecclesall Road between the A61 and
OL,13,Fthe B6375 near Whirlow, which has been
OL,14,Fidentified as one of 27 urban roads in
OL,15,Fthe UK with high collision rates.
OL,17,FThe scheme will include a new 20mph
OL,18,F(32km/h) speed limit between Pear
OL,19,FStreet and Hunters Bar roundabout,
OL,20,Fwhile the existing 30mph (48 km/h)
OL,21,Flimit will be extended to Abbey Lane,
OL,22,Fcouncillors have been told.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
