OL,3,GNEWSAWork on road safety scheme to
OL,4,Astart in January
OL,5,
OL,6,FAverage speed cameras and
OL,7,Fvehicle-activated signs will also be
OL,8,Finstalled, alongside a new pedestrian
OL,9,Fcrossing and an upgraded crossing.
